[ti:Greensleeves]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]Alas, my love, you do me wrong
[00:30.00]To cast me off discourteously
[01:00.00]For I have loved you well and long
[01:30.00]Delighting in your company
[02:00.00]Greensleeves was all my joy
[02:30.00]Greensleeves was my delight
[02:30.67]Greensleeves was my heart of gold
[02:31.33]And who but my lady Greensleeves
